ndefinitely for trade secrets as defined under applicable law.\n\n## 6. RETURN OF MATERIALS\n\nUpon the Disclosing Party\'s written request, the Receiving Party shall promptly return or destroy all materials containing Confidential Information (including all copies, reproductions, and summaries) and certify in writing that such destruction or return has been completed.\n\n## 7. NO LICENSE OR RIGHTS\n\nNothing in this Agreement grants the Receiving Party'}

