f walk or stretching break to release tension\n- **Evening:** Journal 3 things you accomplished, no matter how small\n\n### Recommended Practice Schedule\n| Week | Focus Area | Frequency |\n|------|-----------|-----------|\n| 1 | Deep Breathing | 2x daily (5 min) |\n| 2 | Add Cognitive Reframing | Daily when stressed |\n| 3 | Add Progressive Muscle Relaxation | Before bed |\n| 4 | Combine all techniques | As needed |\n\n---\n\nThese strategies are tailored to help Kevin build resilience against stress and anxiety. Would you like me to elaborate on any specific technique or discuss how to adapt them to Kevin\'s unique circumstances?'}

